            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h3 id=\"system-status\">System Status</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Dashboards:</strong> 3/3 available<br />\n<strong>Accounts:</strong> 5 configured<br />\n<strong>Database:</strong> \u2705 Connected</span>\n<h3 id=\"getting-started\">Getting Started</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Select an account</strong> from the dropdown above</li>\n<li><strong>Click on a dashboard card</strong> to view detailed analytics  </li>\n<li><strong>Use the browser back button</strong> to return to this index page</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"troubleshooting\">Troubleshooting</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>No dashboards showing?</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>Ensure data extraction has been run for your accounts</li>\n<li>Check that job types are registered in the database</li>\n<li>Run the dashboard generation script: <code>uv run python scripts/generate_dashboards.py</code></li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Missing data?</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>Verify that the FastAPI service has extracted data for your account</li>\n<li>Check the database tables contain records for your account ID</li>\n<li>Ensure the account ID matches exactly between extraction and dashboard</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Dashboard errors?</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>Check that all required dependencies are installed</li>\n<li>Verify database schema matches expected structure</li>\n<li>Contact your administrator if problems persist</li>\n</ul></span>"
